subsection.subsection:
In addition to the penalties in Subsection (4), a person who violates this section is subject to:
a civil penalty in an amount not to exceed $5,000 for each violation of this section;
an injunction to restrain a threatened or actual violation of this section; and
recovery by the state for:

the costs of investigation;
the cost of expert witness fees;
the cost of the action; and
reasonable attorney's fees.
